{"id":"word:hebrew:H6951","type":"word","title":"קָהָל","subtitle":"H6951 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"assemblage (usually concretely)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to קָהָל (H6951) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 123 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"קָהָל (qâhâl) means assemblage (usually concretely) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 13 2."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"קָהָל","transliteration":"qâhâl","pronunciation":"kaw-hawl'","strong":"H6951","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6951","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["קְהַ֣ל","הַ/קָּהָ֖ל","קְהַ֥ל","בִּ/קְהַ֥ל","הַ/קָּהָֽל"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncmsa",42],["HNcmsc",22],["HR/Ncmsc",18],["HNcmsa",15],["HRd/Ncmsa",6],["HR/Ncmsa",5],["HC/Td/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmsc/Sp2fs",2],["HNcmsc/Sp3fs",2],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"assemblage (usually concretely)","usage":"assembly, company, congregation, multitude.","full":"H6951. qahal קָהָל 123 noun masculine Ezek 38:15 assembly, convocation, congregation ; — absolute ׳ק Jer 31:8 +; construct קְהַל Exod 12:6 +; suffix קְהָלָ֑ךָ Ezek 38:13 , etc.; plural suffix קְהָלֶיךָ 38:7 ; &#8212; 1 assembly specially convoked: a. for evil counsel , || סוד Gen 49:6 (poem); ׳ק מרעים Psa 26:5 ; for civil affairs Prov 5:14 (see Toy), 26:26 ; Job 30:28 (Di publice ). b. for war or invasion , Num 22:4 (E), Judg 20:2 ; 21:5 , 8 ; 1Sam 17:47 ; Ezek 16:40 ; 38:7 (plural only here), + 8 t. Ezekiel; ׳ק גדול (|| רב חיל ) 38:15 ; ׳ק רב (|| גדול חיל ) 17:17 ; 38:4 ; ׳ק גוים Jer 50:9 ; ׳ק עמים Ezek 23:24 ; 32:3 . c. company of returning exiles, Jer 31:8 ; Ezra 2:64 = Neh 7:66 . d. for religious purposes, to hear words of ׳י at Horeb Deut 5:19 , הק ׳ביום 9:10 ; 10:4 (gloss, not in ᵐ5 ), 18:16 ; word of Jeremiah Jer 26:17 ; 44:15 ; for feasts, fasts and worship 2Chr 20:5 ; 30:25 (twice in verse); Neh 5:13 ; Joel 2:16 ; Psa 107:32 ; ׳ק רב 22:26 4 t.; ק֗֗֗ ׳וַיֵּאָֽסְפו מְאֹד לרב 2Chr 30:13 ; ׳ק גדול 1Kin 8:65 2Chr 7:8 ; (ה)ק ׳בתוך 20:14 ; Psa 22:23 . 2 congregation , as organized body: a. of Israel: ׳ק יהוה Micah 2:5 ; Num 16:3 ; 20:4 (P), 1Chr 28:8 ; ( ׳י ) ׳באבק Deut 23:2 ; 23:3 (twice in verse); 23:4 (twice in verse); 23:9 ; Neh 13:1 ; Lam 1:10 ; ק ׳כל ישׂראל Deut 31:30 ; Josh 8:35 (D) Lev 16:17 (P) 1Kin 8:14 (twice in verse); 8:22 , 55 2Chr 6:3 (twice in verse); 6:12-13 , 1Kin 12:3 ; 1Chr 13:2 ; ק ׳כל ישׂראל עדת Exod 12:6 ( ᵐ5 reads בני before ׳יִשׂ ), Num 14:5 (P; ᵐ5 συναγωγή ; ᵑ0 probably conflation); הק עם ׳כל Lev 16:33 ; הק ׳כל Exod 16:3 (P) 1Chr 13:4 12 t. Chronicles; ׳הק Lev 4:13-14 , 21 8 t. Numbers (P) 8 t. 2 Chronicles b. restored community in Jerusalem Ezra 10:12 , 14 ; Neh 8:2 , 17 ; ׳ק הֵגּוֺלָה Ezra 10:8 ; later the better part of it, ׳ק חסידים Psa 149:1 . c. of angels , ׳ק קדשׁים Psa 89:6 . d. more General: company , assembled multitude, ׳ק גוים Gen 35:11 (P), ׳ק עמים 28:3 ; 48:4 (P), ׳ק רפאים Prov 21:16 .","rootNote":"from 6950 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 13 2","keyReferences":["1Chr 13 2","1Chr 13 4","1Chr 28 8","1Chr 29 1","1Chr 29 10","1Chr 29 20","1Chr 29 20","1Kgs 8 14"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":123,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 13 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קְהַ֣ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 13 4","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/קָּהָ֖ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קְהַל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/קָּהָ֔ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":